<div class="authenticity-guarantee" data-section-id="{{ section.id }}">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="auth-guarantee__wrapper">

      <div class="auth-guarantee__header fade-up">
        <h2>{{ section.settings.title | default: 'GARANTIE AUTHENTICITÉ' }}</h2>
        <p>{{ section.settings.subtitle | default: 'Chaque pièce VELLORA PARIS est rigoureusement inspectée' }}</p>
      </div>

      <div class="auth-guarantee__grid">

        <div class="auth-guarantee__item fade-up" style="animation-delay: 0.1s;">
          <div class="auth-guarantee__icon">
            <svg width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>100% VÉRIFIÉ</h3>
          <p>Nos experts indépendants vérifient chaque détail, des coutures aux matériaux, pour garantir l'authenticité absolue.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="auth-guarantee__item fade-up" style="animation-delay: 0.2s;">
          <div class="auth-guarantee__icon">
            <svg width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/><polyline points="10 9 9 9 8 9"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>CERTIFICAT INCLUS</h3>
          <p>Un certificat officiel avec numéro de série unique est délivré avec chaque commande pour une traçabilité totale.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="auth-guarantee__item fade-up" style="animation-delay: 0.3s;">
          <div class="auth-guarantee__icon">
            <svg width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 8v4"/><path d="M12 16h.01"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>RETOURS SÉCURISÉS</h3>
          <p>La pièce ne vous convient pas ? Renvoyez-la sous 30 jours, à condition que le sceau de garantie VELLORA soit intact.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .authenticity-guarantee {
    padding: 80px 0;
    background-color: #f8f8f8;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }
  .auth-guarantee__wrapper {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .auth-guarantee__header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 50px;
  }
  .auth-guarantee__header h2 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }
  .auth-guarantee__header p {
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }
  .auth-guarantee__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 40px;
  }
  @media screen and (min-width: 768px) {
    .auth-guarantee__grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 30px;
    }
  }
  .auth-guarantee__item {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 30px;
    background: var(--color-background);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }
  .auth-guarantee__item:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
  }
  .auth-guarantee__icon {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 80px;
    height: 80px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(46, 125, 50, 0.05);
    color: #2e7d32;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .auth-guarantee__item h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }
  .auth-guarantee__item p {
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Garantie Authenticité",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "title",
      "label": "Titre"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "subtitle",
      "label": "Sous-titre"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Garantie Authenticité",
      "category": "Texte"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
